  "idea": "Notion automated database buttons for recurring task creation",
  "text": "Supercharge your Notion workspace with these built-in database automation rules. Teams struggle with disorganized task boards because nobody remembers to assign due dates or tag department leads. Untagged tasks get buried beneath new requests, leaving urgent client tickets completely abandoned. Build internal trigger rules inside Notion that automatically apply assignees, update deadlines, and move completed items. Your workspace manages itself without third-party tools, giving you your weekends back.",
